# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# PLV NaviSync — Environment Variables
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your values:
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# Then run the SQL migration in supabase/migrations/001_initial_schema.sql
# in your Supabase project's SQL Editor.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Supabase ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Get these from your Supabase project dashboard → Settings → API
# https://supabase.com/dashboard/project/YOUR_PROJECT/settings/api
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

# ── Optional: SMTP for email notifications ───────────────────────────────
# Used by the admin settings page for sending report notifications
VITE_SMTP_HOST=
VITE_SMTP_PORT=587
VITE_SMTP_USER=
VITE_SMTP_PASS=
VITE_SMTP_FROM=noreply@plv.edu.ph

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Quick Start Guide
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 1. Create a free Supabase project at https://supabase.com
# 2. Go to Project Settings → API and copy your URL and anon key
# 3. Paste them above in VITE_SUPABASE_URL and VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY
# 4. Go to SQL Editor, paste supabase/migrations/001_initial_schema.sql, run it
# 5. Go to Authentication → Settings → enable email/password sign-up
# 6. Run `pnpm dev` to start the app
# 7. Register your first admin account, then manually set role='admin' in Supabase Table Editor
# 8. Run: pnpm supabase gen types --lang=ts > src/services/database.gen.ts
